And he's got all these gifts that he's giving Marshall and Lily.
他拥有送给马歇尔和莉莉的所有这些礼物。

00:33:39.200 --> 00:33:40.200
Yes.
是的。

00:33:40.200 --> 00:33:41.200
Yes.
是的。

00:33:41.200 --> 00:33:42.200
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

00:33:42.200 --> 00:33:46.279
The nightnight Lily song where Ted is being forced to both videotape it and harmonize.
特德被迫将《夜夜莉莉》的歌曲录下来并进行和声。

00:33:46.279 --> 00:33:47.279
Yeah.
是的。

00:33:47.279 --> 00:33:50.599
I was trying to remember if I was on set or that was just something we lose.
我试图记住我是否在片场，或者这只是我们失去的东西。

00:33:50.599 --> 00:33:51.599
You were.
你是。

00:33:51.599 --> 00:33:52.599
No, you had to time it out.
不，你必须超时。

00:33:52.599 --> 00:33:53.599
You had to do it.
你必须这么做。

00:33:53.599 --> 00:33:56.299
you were they are standing right next to the camera.
你是他们站在相机旁边。

00:33:56.299 --> 00:33:57.140
Yeah, yeah, that's right.
是啊是啊，没错。

00:33:57.140 --> 00:33:58.559
Cause you had to sound that way.
因为你必须听起来那样。

00:33:58.559 --> 00:34:00.160
You were, yeah, you were in there.
是的，你当时就在那里。

00:34:00.160 --> 00:34:01.519
That was really funny to me.
这对我来说真的很有趣。

00:34:01.519 --> 00:34:02.359
Yeah.
是的。

00:34:02.359 --> 00:34:03.200
So funny.
太有趣了。

00:34:03.200 --> 00:34:06.400
And then the Ted grudgingly does it, he's like, all right, I'll do it.
然后特德不情愿地做了，他说，好吧，我会做的。

00:34:06.400 --> 00:34:12.199
Way later in series, Marshall's lullaby to his son is Night Night Little Marvin.
在剧集的后期，马歇尔为儿子唱的摇篮曲是《夜夜小马文》。

00:34:12.199 --> 00:34:15.280
It was a completely different melody and song that we wrote many, many years later.
这是我们很多很多年后写的完全不同的旋律和歌曲。

00:34:15.280 --> 00:34:17.559
But I had to forgot we made it match.
但我不得不忘记我们已经匹配了。

00:34:17.559 --> 00:34:22.159
He has a Night Night song for Lily and now they have a kid and he says Night Night Little Marvin to his little son.
他为莉莉唱了一首《夜夜》歌曲，现在他们有了一个孩子，他对他的小儿子说《夜夜小马文》。

00:34:22.159 --> 00:34:24.320
So it's, I guess maybe we did that intentionally.
所以，我想也许我们是故意这样做的。

00:34:24.320 --> 00:34:25.599
I couldn't even remember.
我什至不记得了。

00:34:25.599 --> 00:34:31.480
Oh, I wrote a song called Brooklyn Girl for Chordana and she says, is there gonna be a Brooklyn boy?
哦，我为 Chordana 写了一首名为《布鲁克林女孩》的歌曲，她说，会有一个布鲁克林男孩吗？

00:34:31.480 --> 00:34:34.199
Ah, he's just, right it, do it.
啊，他只是，对了，就这么做。

00:34:34.199 --> 00:34:35.039
Yeah.
是的。

00:34:35.039 --> 00:34:36.039
I'll get on there right now.
我现在就去那里。

00:34:36.039 --> 00:34:36.880
On the spot.
当场。

00:34:36.880 --> 00:34:37.880
Get the guitar.
拿起吉他。

00:34:37.880 --> 00:34:40.239
I am guilty.
我有罪。

00:34:40.239 --> 00:34:42.119
Please equip me.
请装备我。

00:34:42.119 --> 00:34:44.440
All sins are forgiven.
所有的罪孽都被宽恕了。

00:34:44.440 --> 00:34:46.639
In New York City.
在纽约市。

